            <ArticleTitle>The Rise of Post-Grant Proceedings.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>4-6</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1021/acsmedchemlett.6b00460</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This viewpoint provides a brief overview of the procedures for initiating post-grant proceedings before the United States Patent Trial and Appeal Board, including a discussion of why companies are now commonly electing to use those proceedings, both as part of an overall litigation strategy and outside of the litigation context.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
